      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Inside Heavenly Court, Star Constellation holds Spectral Soul in star fog while Fang Yuan and Giant Sun arrive and attack, and Star Constellation uses Heavenly Court’s wisdom path dao mark amplification to endure their opening methods.",
